                "html": "<h4 class=\"center\">Mining the sea floor</h4>\n<p>Mining corporations believe that the mineral resources lying under the sea may be superior to those found in the earth. They also say that these can be removed without producing much [[24]].</p>\n<p>The extraction is often done by adapting the [[25]] that has already been used to work on land. The method of excavation involves removing the seawater from the slurry that is brought up to ships and returning it to the seabed. However, concerned groups strongly believe that [[26]] is necessary due to the possible number of unidentified consequences.</p>"
